---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { partnerNetworkUrl } from '../facts';

// Copy repris de about.html, nettoyé.
// Ce qui a été retiré et pourquoi est dans docs/REVIEW.md, section « Retiré »,
// avec la ligne de restauration de chaque passage.
---

<Base
  title="About Syntexia"
  description="Syntexia builds voice and document systems that run inside the tools a company already uses."
  path="/about"
>
  <section class="section first">
    <div class="shell">
      <h1>The era of generic AI is ending. What comes next runs inside the business.</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Most organisations do not need another general-purpose model with a clever
          prompt. They need intelligence that lives where the work happens: in the inbox,
          the phone line, the CRM, the accounting system, the operations stack.
        </p>
        <p>
          Syntexia is built on a single idea. Real intelligence is embedded, not bolted
          on. It reads the same documents your team reads. It picks up the phone. It
          writes the report. It catches the discrepancy before it becomes a problem.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are not selling a platform staff have to learn. We are building the
          intelligence layer for serious operations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2>The work is methodical.</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We start by mapping the systems already in use, the questions teams are already
          asking, the operations that consume their time. Then we embed intelligence into
          that fabric, quietly, without asking anyone to learn a new tool.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {partnerNetworkUrl && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell">
        <h2>Anthropic Claude Partner Network</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            We build with Claude, the model family we believe sets the standard for the
            kind of careful, high-stakes work our customers operate in.
            <a href={partnerNetworkUrl.value} rel="noopener">Read the announcement</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2>The team</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p><a href="/team">See who builds it</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .first { border-top: 0; }
  .prose { margin-top: var(--s-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-5); }
</style>
